    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const topic = $json.topic || '';\nconst resumo = $json.resumo || '';\nconst postFinal = $json.post_final || '';\nconst hashtags = $json.hashtags || '';\n\nconst imagePrompt = `Create a professional editorial image for a LinkedIn post about: \"${topic}\".\n\nBackground facts: ${resumo}\n\nPost narrative/angle: ${postFinal}\n\nSEO keywords: ${hashtags}\n\nInstructions: identify 2 to 3 concrete, literal visual elements directly tied to the real subject of this story (specific objects, setting, symbols related to the actual topic - not generic abstractions like \"growth\" or \"risk\" alone). Combine these concrete elements with a subtle financial/investment visual layer (charts, data overlays, office/analysis elements), balanced, not overpowering the main subject.\n\nIMPORTANT SAFETY RULE: if the topic involves someone's religion, personal faith, health condition, tragedy, or other sensitive personal matters, DO NOT depict religious symbols, faith objects, health-related imagery, or anything tied to that sensitive personal element. In that case, rely only on the financial/investment visual layer (charts, office setting, abstract market elements) and skip illustrating the sensitive part entirely.\n\nStyle: editorial photography or modern corporate illustration. Use specific photographic details: soft directional lighting, shallow depth of field, natural color grading. Avoid generic terms like \"high quality\" or \"minimalist\" - be specific about light, texture, and composition instead.\n\nColor palette: navy blue, gray, white, with a subtle gold accent (brand consistency).\n\nFormat: square (1:1 aspect ratio).\n\nStrict exclusions: no text, no numbers, no logos, no recognizable people, absolutely no references to gambling, casinos, or betting.`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...$json,\n    imagePrompt: imagePrompt\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        400,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "d103c03a-6def-48f2-831e-2f50b8a0f901",
      "name": "14. Diretor de Arte - Montar Prompt"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  contents: [{ parts: [{ text: $json.imagePrompt }] }],\n  generationConfig: { responseModalities: [\"IMAGE\"] }\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        608,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "083cfe69-8a09-4e4d-839a-09f503010f8e",
      "name": "14. Diretor de Arte - Gerar Imagem",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CONFIGURAR",
          "name": "Gemini API (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const parts = $json.candidates[0].content.parts;\nconst imagePart = parts.find(p => p.inlineData);\n\nif (!imagePart) {\n  throw new Error('Nenhuma imagem encontrada na resposta do Gemini.');\n}\n\nconst base64Data = imagePart.inlineData.data;\nconst mimeType = imagePart.inlineData.mimeType || 'image/png';\nconst extensao = mimeType.split('/')[1] || 'png';\nconst fileName = `post_${Date.now()}.${extensao}`;\nconst buffer = Buffer.from(base64Data, 'base64');\n\nconst binaryData = await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(buffer, fileName, mimeType);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    fileName: fileName\n  },\n  binary: {\n    data: binaryData\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
